{"step_index":64,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T10:52:24Z","content":"Full report is ready. Here's the quick summary:\n\n### @PsychToonsHQ — Key Numbers\n\n| Metric | NexLev (Real) | vidIQ (Estimate) |\n|--------|-------------|-----------------|\n| **Monthly Revenue** | **\\$5,594** | \\$9,900 ❌ (+77% inflated) |\n| **RPM** | **\\$1.69** | Not shown |\n| **Monthly Views** | **3.4M** | ~3.7M (30D) |\n| **Tier 1 Traffic** | **75.2%** | Not shown |\n| **Demographics** | 85% male, 55% aged 18-34 | Not shown |\n\n### 🔥 vidIQ vs NexLev — The Big Takeaway\n\n**vidIQ overestimates revenue by 77%** (\\$9.9K vs \\$5.6K real). It doesn't account for the 24.8% India traffic dragging down RPM. NexLev gives the real \\$1.69 RPM + full demographic breakdown that vidIQ doesn't show.\n\n### Where PsychToons Ranks (vs all 10 channels):\n- **🥇 Fastest growing** — +210% sub growth, exploding right now\n- **\\$67K/year** projected at current rate\n- **Lowest RPM** of all channels (\\$1.69) — compensates with massive views\n- **⭐⭐⭐⭐ HARD to replicate** — needs custom illustrations + animation + psychology research + 5 uploads/week. This is NOT a solo-creator-in-PowerPoint format like Math Education or Tech Explainers."}
